WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:34.990
[The Heir]

01:35.370 --> 01:37.910
[Episode 2]

02:08.310 --> 02:10.240
We saved for a lifetime.

02:12.000 --> 02:13.560
And in an instant...

02:16.120 --> 02:17.190
it's all gone.

02:20.030 --> 02:21.430
Mother, don't be afraid.

02:21.430 --> 02:23.190
I'll go find work in a few days.

02:23.190 --> 02:25.360
I won't let you and Zhen suffer.

02:26.960 --> 02:28.430
Zhengliang, you've grown up.

02:28.430 --> 02:30.120
Mother, where will we go?

02:30.870 --> 02:33.560
Let's find a place nearby
to settle down first.

02:35.120 --> 02:36.780
With your father's health...

02:39.590 --> 02:40.240
Father.

02:41.710 --> 02:42.400
Mother.

02:42.750 --> 02:43.800
Your things.

02:55.430 --> 02:56.520
Thank you, Zhen.

03:00.710 --> 03:01.360
Not only did you of the Eighth Branch

03:01.360 --> 03:03.360
take a life from the Li family,

03:04.430 --> 03:06.630
but you also want to take treasures too?

03:09.240 --> 03:11.360
This is the bone-paring knife
from my dowry.

03:11.360 --> 03:12.690
It's my own possession.

03:12.750 --> 03:14.190
But since it was a dowry,

03:14.470 --> 03:16.000
it belongs to the Li family.

03:17.120 --> 03:18.920
It's just a worldly possession.

03:19.360 --> 03:20.420
I can do without it!

03:22.800 --> 03:23.400
Let's go.

03:25.360 --> 03:25.870
Father.

03:26.400 --> 03:27.000
Father.

03:27.310 --> 03:27.840
Let's go.

03:56.079 --> 03:57.010
Sister-in-law,

03:57.800 --> 03:58.680
Jingfu,

03:59.360 --> 04:00.430
please wait!

04:06.840 --> 04:08.000
Mother sent me here

04:08.360 --> 04:09.840
to bring you some things.

04:14.400 --> 04:15.930
These are for the children.

04:18.430 --> 04:19.269
This is...

04:23.270 --> 04:25.130
These are the birthday inksticks

04:26.160 --> 04:28.480
I made for Zhen and Zhengliang.

04:29.000 --> 04:31.950
The birthday inksticks
for the kids of the Li family

04:32.950 --> 04:35.159
are all kept with Aunt Junru.

04:36.190 --> 04:38.320
It's kind of Seventh Aunt to remember.

04:39.270 --> 04:40.800
Thank you for your trouble.

04:40.870 --> 04:41.750
Jingfu.

04:43.920 --> 04:45.630
This is the portrait of our ancestor,

04:45.630 --> 04:47.120
Li Tinggui.

04:47.510 --> 04:48.720
Take it with you.

04:49.310 --> 04:51.870
Although you have left the Li family,

04:52.120 --> 04:54.360
Mother hopes you will not forget

04:55.040 --> 04:57.040
that your roots will always be here.

05:07.600 --> 05:08.530
Sister-in-law,

05:09.680 --> 05:10.830
this is for you.

05:14.120 --> 05:15.050
Sister-in-law,

05:15.430 --> 05:16.190
I...

05:18.870 --> 05:20.240
Thank you, Sister-in-law.

05:20.240 --> 05:23.480
Mother also asked me to pass on a message.

05:24.950 --> 05:27.630
As long as there is food, there is a way.

05:28.430 --> 05:29.920
Keep your spirits up.

05:31.000 --> 05:31.950
Don't lose hope.

05:54.190 --> 05:54.990
Come quickly!

05:56.120 --> 05:57.159
Stop it!

05:57.180 --> 05:58.550
What is this nonsense?

05:59.270 --> 06:01.800
Benchang is leading Ronghua
to steal things!

06:02.000 --> 06:03.240
What is going on here?

06:03.310 --> 06:04.160
Mother,

06:04.400 --> 06:09.170
[The eldest son of the Tian family,
Tian Benchang]

06:04.480 --> 06:05.870
something happened to Zhen's family.

06:05.870 --> 06:07.670
The whole family was kicked out.

06:07.750 --> 06:08.720
I thought,

06:08.720 --> 06:11.160
since our family has always been close
to the Eighth Branch,

06:10.920 --> 06:15.060
[The head of the Tian family,
Tian Huai'an]

06:11.160 --> 06:12.630
we should help them.

06:12.920 --> 06:14.130
Mother, don't misunderstand.

06:14.130 --> 06:15.130
Ronghua and I

06:15.160 --> 06:17.000
saved these things ourselves.

06:17.160 --> 06:18.720
We didn't take them from the family.

06:18.720 --> 06:20.560
You can't use your own savings either.

06:20.560 --> 06:22.240
Things are different now.

06:22.270 --> 06:23.950
The Eighth Branch
has been removed from the family register

06:23.060 --> 06:25.430
[Daughter of the Tian family,
Tian Ronghua]

06:23.950 --> 06:24.920
and disowned.

06:24.920 --> 06:27.120
They will be nothing
but destitute in the future.

06:26.570 --> 06:29.040
[Mistress of the Tian family,
Wang Xiu]

06:27.700 --> 06:29.310
I won't allow you to help them.

06:29.310 --> 06:31.600
Zhen grew up playing with Hua and me.

06:31.600 --> 06:32.870
She never looked down on us.

06:32.870 --> 06:34.680
Do you dare talk back to me?

06:34.680 --> 06:35.540
That's enough.

06:36.190 --> 06:37.390
I think

06:37.950 --> 06:39.280
Chang made a good point.

06:48.120 --> 06:49.510
You are kind and righteous.

06:49.510 --> 06:51.240
I am very pleased.

06:53.120 --> 06:55.680
Ronghua, girls should stay at home.

06:56.270 --> 06:58.870
Chang, go deliver your gift quickly.

06:59.270 --> 07:00.190
Be quick.

07:00.190 --> 07:00.750
Okay.

07:02.630 --> 07:03.270
Stop.

07:05.390 --> 07:06.520
Why are you running?

07:07.720 --> 07:08.750
At a time like this,

07:08.750 --> 07:09.750
you still want to go out?

07:09.750 --> 07:10.600
Father.

07:10.630 --> 07:12.070
I want to visit a friend.

07:12.070 --> 07:12.800
You can't go.

07:13.000 --> 07:13.750
Father,

07:13.750 --> 07:14.950
I beg you.

07:15.190 --> 07:16.390
Keep an eye on him.

07:16.830 --> 07:18.190
Once the sedan and horses are ready,

07:18.190 --> 07:19.720
you'll leave immediately.

07:21.160 --> 07:22.190
Father!

07:26.270 --> 07:27.780
Where are you running to?

07:28.240 --> 07:29.040
Brother!

07:29.310 --> 07:30.870
Brother, put me down.

07:30.870 --> 07:32.800
I have something to tell you.

07:34.000 --> 07:34.800
Really?

07:38.560 --> 07:40.920
You have a lot going on for your age.

07:46.950 --> 07:47.600
Speak.

07:49.120 --> 07:50.120
I...

07:51.600 --> 07:53.000
About that girl?

07:55.610 --> 07:57.530
How about this?

07:58.800 --> 08:01.240
If I find out anything about her,

08:01.430 --> 08:04.160
I'll send letters to the Capital.
Is that okay?

08:04.430 --> 08:05.360
Really?

08:05.720 --> 08:07.510
Why would I lie to you about this?

08:07.510 --> 08:08.430
Anything else?

08:09.120 --> 08:09.870
Brother,

08:10.120 --> 08:12.850
actually, I don't want to
go to the Capital at all.

08:12.920 --> 08:14.040
I don't want to study,

08:14.040 --> 08:15.510
and I certainly don't want to
be an official.

08:15.510 --> 08:17.190
There's nothing there.

08:17.390 --> 08:18.680
No one to talk to,

08:18.680 --> 08:19.800
no one to play with.

08:20.120 --> 08:21.630
Everything I do is wrong.

08:22.120 --> 08:23.320
Father and my teacher

08:23.490 --> 08:24.980
never smile at me.

08:28.000 --> 08:30.560
If one day Father laughed with you,

08:32.360 --> 08:33.690
wouldn't you be scared?

08:34.360 --> 08:35.150
Brother,

08:35.320 --> 08:37.080
I know Father means well,

08:37.510 --> 08:39.120
but if I don't want to do something,

08:39.120 --> 08:40.520
I just don't want to do it.

08:42.080 --> 08:43.510
Then what do you want to do?

08:43.510 --> 08:44.600
I...

08:45.600 --> 08:46.870
I haven't decided yet.

08:47.440 --> 08:50.100
But Li Zhen said I could be
a traveling merchant.

08:51.030 --> 08:52.760
What others say doesn't count.

08:53.370 --> 08:54.520
If a person

08:54.550 --> 08:55.870
wants to do something,

08:57.630 --> 09:01.200
you have to ask yourself
if you really want to do it.

09:02.510 --> 09:03.440
Let me tell you,

09:03.870 --> 09:04.670
first of all,

09:05.030 --> 09:05.960
I

09:06.320 --> 09:07.670
absolutely support you

09:07.670 --> 09:09.480
in doing what you want.

09:10.120 --> 09:11.000
But

09:11.360 --> 09:14.120
you must first know what you want to do.

09:14.790 --> 09:17.360
How can you know what you want to do?

09:17.600 --> 09:19.530
You need to broaden your horizons.

09:19.720 --> 09:21.000
Huizhou is small.

09:21.120 --> 09:22.750
The Capital is big.

09:22.910 --> 09:24.120
It has so many people.

09:24.870 --> 09:26.840
You need to know what those people

09:27.390 --> 09:29.200
do every day,

09:30.360 --> 09:32.000
eat every day,

09:32.510 --> 09:34.240
and think about every day.

09:34.680 --> 09:36.200
When you understand it all,

09:36.200 --> 09:38.060
you'll suddenly realize one day,

09:39.200 --> 09:41.750
"This is what I want to do!"

09:42.510 --> 09:43.550
Do you understand?

09:43.550 --> 09:44.550
I understand.

09:45.150 --> 09:45.870
Brother.

09:46.510 --> 09:48.150
I want to make more friends

09:48.320 --> 09:51.270
and see the wider world.

09:51.390 --> 09:52.910
When I get to the Capital,

09:53.080 --> 09:54.480
if I have no one to talk to,

09:54.550 --> 09:55.720
I'll write to you,

09:55.720 --> 09:56.510
okay?

09:57.480 --> 09:58.000
Don't.

09:58.480 --> 09:59.440
I don't have time

09:59.440 --> 10:01.440
to read your naggy letter.

10:01.960 --> 10:02.840
Brother.

10:02.840 --> 10:03.700
How about this?

10:03.910 --> 10:05.360
After a few days,

10:05.480 --> 10:07.880
I have a batch of ink
to deliver to the north.

10:08.110 --> 10:09.600
If I have time,

10:10.000 --> 10:11.910
I'll visit you in the Capital.

10:11.910 --> 10:14.390
I don't want you to visit.

10:14.920 --> 10:17.120
If not me, then who?

10:17.510 --> 10:18.310
What's wrong?

10:20.270 --> 10:20.670
What's wrong?

10:20.670 --> 10:21.320
Brother,

10:21.630 --> 10:23.390
I think my tooth fell out.

10:24.910 --> 10:27.910
It really did.

10:28.630 --> 10:30.490
According to the ink guild rules,

10:30.910 --> 10:34.120
this tooth should be inspected
by the Grandmaster.

10:35.670 --> 10:37.000
You don't study ink making.

10:37.000 --> 10:38.270
Why show it to him?

10:38.390 --> 10:39.590
Upper or lower tooth?

10:39.630 --> 10:40.390
Upper.

10:41.270 --> 10:41.960
Let me see.

10:44.480 --> 10:45.210
Come with me.

10:48.390 --> 10:49.510
I never cared

10:49.550 --> 10:51.270
about the rules,

10:51.750 --> 10:54.010
but I still made Luo Ink into Tribute Ink.

10:54.200 --> 10:55.460
You should be the same.

10:56.080 --> 10:59.270
Do what you want with all your heart.

10:59.270 --> 11:01.150
Forget the family rules.

11:04.390 --> 11:05.510
One day,

11:06.030 --> 11:08.030
I will make Luo Ink

11:08.030 --> 11:09.750
the best of Hui Ink.

11:10.630 --> 11:13.270
If you go into business when you grow up,

11:13.320 --> 11:14.600
help me

11:15.030 --> 11:17.790
open Luo Ink shops all over the world.

11:18.360 --> 11:19.600
Deal?

11:20.000 --> 11:21.000
Deal.

11:25.320 --> 11:26.120
Then...

11:27.870 --> 11:28.720
let's go.

11:29.030 --> 11:29.750
Let's go!

11:37.680 --> 11:40.710
[Boya Garden]

11:40.630 --> 11:42.240
Young Master, hurry.

12:16.000 --> 12:17.320
Father, Mother,

12:17.870 --> 12:19.320
I've asked around.

12:19.440 --> 12:21.600
The city gate has a butcher shop,

12:23.320 --> 12:24.510
a tofu shop,

12:24.600 --> 12:25.600
a clinic,

12:25.670 --> 12:27.030
and a food stall.

12:27.560 --> 12:29.440
The food stall's owner is Mr. Shui.

12:29.440 --> 12:31.000
He's very nice.

12:31.240 --> 12:33.120
He's an old acquaintance of Grandpa too.

12:33.120 --> 12:34.320
Zhen is back?

12:36.910 --> 12:37.480
Here,

12:37.480 --> 12:38.200
for you.

12:49.430 --> 12:52.960
[Just like pine smoke]

12:58.150 --> 12:59.390
-Jingfu!
-Father!

12:59.550 --> 13:00.910
-Jingfu!
-Father!

13:01.320 --> 13:02.720
-Jingfu!
-Father!

13:03.360 --> 13:04.000
Father!

13:04.000 --> 13:05.720
Jingfu! Jingfu!

13:12.080 --> 13:12.840
Doctor,

13:13.630 --> 13:15.360
is my son's condition serious?

13:15.480 --> 13:18.480
The patient was already
suffering from tuberculosis

13:18.960 --> 13:20.910
and his body was severely weakened.

13:20.910 --> 13:22.270
Recently,

13:22.270 --> 13:23.030
he must have

13:23.320 --> 13:24.780
suffered some hardships.

13:24.880 --> 13:27.000
Coupled with excessive worry,

13:27.480 --> 13:28.750
it accelerated his illness.

13:28.750 --> 13:29.910
Doctor, just tell us,

13:29.910 --> 13:30.910
how do we treat it?

13:33.320 --> 13:35.050
My medical skills are lacking.

13:35.510 --> 13:37.040
I really can't do anything.

13:38.410 --> 13:41.890
If you could invite
the miracle doctor, Old Master Xue,

13:42.000 --> 13:43.460
there might still be hope.

13:43.550 --> 13:46.960
But Old Master Xue is renowned.

13:47.120 --> 13:50.320
I'm afraid
only wealthy families can invite him.

13:52.630 --> 13:53.690
I'll take my leave.

13:56.510 --> 13:58.510
Mother, I'll go to Seventh Grandmother.

13:58.510 --> 14:00.910
She won't just sit by and watch.

14:01.720 --> 14:02.750
I'll go with Zhen.

14:10.380 --> 14:11.170
Help!

14:11.200 --> 14:12.320
Open the door! Is anyone there?

14:12.320 --> 14:15.630
Is anyone there? Please save my father!

14:18.320 --> 14:19.750
Young Master Zhengliang,

14:19.750 --> 14:21.600
Miss Zhen, why are you here?

14:21.600 --> 14:22.390
Mr. Zhou,

14:22.390 --> 14:23.920
my father is seriously ill.

14:24.080 --> 14:27.080
We need Seventh Grandmother
to invite Old Master Xue.

14:27.200 --> 14:29.270
Please let us see Seventh Grandmother.

14:29.270 --> 14:31.750
Mr. Zhou, I beg you.

14:32.110 --> 14:34.480
Please save my father.

14:34.480 --> 14:35.240
All right.

14:35.550 --> 14:37.240
I'll go in and announce you.

14:37.270 --> 14:38.150
Wait a moment.

14:38.750 --> 14:39.510
Halt.

14:46.320 --> 14:47.360
You can't go.

14:52.080 --> 14:53.670
Please come out!

15:01.030 --> 15:03.960
Third Master Chen
has already invited Doctor Xue over.

15:03.960 --> 15:05.390
He should be fine now.

15:05.600 --> 15:06.910
That Tian Jiangyue.

15:07.600 --> 15:09.120
It's a matter of life and death.

15:09.120 --> 15:10.650
How dare she do such a thing?

15:14.120 --> 15:15.080
Doctor Xue,

15:15.550 --> 15:16.510
how is he?

15:16.510 --> 15:18.840
Seventh Old Madam, First Young Mistress,

15:18.910 --> 15:20.080
I was a step too late.

15:20.120 --> 15:22.720
If strong medicine
had been administered earlier,

15:22.720 --> 15:24.850
perhaps he could have pulled through.

15:33.600 --> 15:34.910
In the end...

15:35.840 --> 15:37.270
it's too late.

15:38.960 --> 15:39.870
Jingfu?

15:42.360 --> 15:43.240
Jingfu?

16:00.480 --> 16:01.480
My son,

16:03.200 --> 16:04.440
I don't blame you.

16:10.590 --> 16:11.760
I don't blame you.

16:23.750 --> 16:24.720
Jingfu.

16:25.510 --> 16:26.510
Jingfu.

16:27.600 --> 16:30.240
Didn't you say you'd take us
back to Yi County?

16:31.480 --> 16:33.840
You said that was where I grew up.

16:34.630 --> 16:36.510
You promised us.

16:38.670 --> 16:39.480
Father.

16:39.510 --> 16:40.320
Jingfu,

16:40.750 --> 16:42.080
if you leave,

16:42.630 --> 16:45.740
who will take care of Zhen,
Zhengliang, and me?

16:46.360 --> 16:47.440
Jingfu!

16:48.150 --> 16:49.360
Father,

16:49.790 --> 16:52.720
didn't Doctor Xue come?

16:52.870 --> 16:55.270
He can definitely cure you.

16:56.670 --> 16:58.000
Father!

16:58.080 --> 16:59.510
Jingfu!

17:00.790 --> 17:02.240
Jingfu!

17:19.970 --> 17:25.770
[Li Jingfu's Tomb]

17:29.240 --> 17:30.070
Mother,

17:30.920 --> 17:34.000
just because our names
were removed from the family register,

17:34.000 --> 17:37.280
does that mean
we're no longer part of the Li family?

17:40.270 --> 17:41.960
Even if we aren't family,

17:42.200 --> 17:43.880
as one human to another,

17:44.000 --> 17:46.310
how could they just watch him die?

17:49.880 --> 17:50.720
Zhen.

17:51.960 --> 17:53.510
Everyone is different.

17:55.070 --> 17:56.670
But we can't control others.

17:58.160 --> 17:59.620
We must conduct ourselves

17:59.680 --> 18:01.480
so we can answer to heaven and earth,

18:01.480 --> 18:03.030
and to our own consciences.

18:05.030 --> 18:06.400
From today on,

18:06.960 --> 18:08.290
forget about that home.

18:09.110 --> 18:10.480
This is our home now.

18:11.070 --> 18:12.130
Do you understand?

18:13.240 --> 18:14.000
Yes.

18:15.590 --> 18:16.200
Alright.

18:16.310 --> 18:17.240
Don't cry.

18:18.350 --> 18:19.080
Stop crying.

18:20.880 --> 18:21.750
Tomorrow,

18:21.920 --> 18:24.070
I'll set up a silkworm bed here.

18:24.110 --> 18:25.440
Let's raise silkworms.

18:26.200 --> 18:27.830
When the silkworms grow up

18:27.880 --> 18:29.210
and spin their cocoons,

18:29.310 --> 18:32.110
I can make a new outfit for you

18:32.550 --> 18:34.750
and a new pair of shoes for your brother.

18:35.350 --> 18:38.240
But you have to help me
pick mulberry leaves.

18:38.350 --> 18:39.160
Okay?

18:39.480 --> 18:40.310
Okay.

18:41.720 --> 18:43.070
We'll also put a bamboo bed

18:43.070 --> 18:44.350
outside the house.

18:44.880 --> 18:47.880
We can watch the moon in autumn,
the snow in the winter,

18:48.310 --> 18:50.720
and enjoy the cool air in the summer.

18:51.350 --> 18:52.950
We can even watch fireflies.

18:53.480 --> 18:54.110
Look.

18:54.160 --> 18:55.760
There's an empty plot there.

18:56.000 --> 18:58.110
I plan on growing some vegetables

18:58.160 --> 19:00.690
and raising some chickens,
ducks, and geese.

19:01.790 --> 19:03.790
I'll also plant some balsam flowers

19:03.960 --> 19:05.550
outside the courtyard wall

19:05.720 --> 19:07.640
to paint your nails.

19:07.880 --> 19:08.550
Mother.

19:09.480 --> 19:11.200
I want to eat grapes.

19:11.720 --> 19:12.510
Sure.

19:13.270 --> 19:14.400
Then...

19:14.960 --> 19:15.750
Outside,

19:16.680 --> 19:17.880
we'll set up a trellis

19:18.350 --> 19:20.030
and grow grapes for you.

19:24.750 --> 19:25.680
Mother,

19:25.960 --> 19:27.640
will everything you just said

19:27.640 --> 19:29.350
really come true?

19:29.400 --> 19:30.480
Of course.

19:31.640 --> 19:33.000
It definitely will.

19:33.350 --> 19:34.350
I promise you.

19:35.550 --> 19:36.070
Come on.

19:49.520 --> 19:54.270
[Ten years later]

19:54.030 --> 19:54.880
Zhen,

19:55.070 --> 19:56.070
are you up yet?

19:56.680 --> 19:58.010
I've been up for a while!

20:03.590 --> 20:04.310
Zhen,

20:04.720 --> 20:06.270
there are two boiled eggs on the table.

20:06.270 --> 20:08.270
Take them with you to eat on the road.

20:09.920 --> 20:10.640
Grandpa!

20:11.640 --> 20:12.480
Going to work?

20:12.790 --> 20:14.110
Here, leave it to me.

20:14.640 --> 20:15.750
You go to work. Be a good girl.

20:15.750 --> 20:16.200
Give it to me.

20:16.200 --> 20:16.480
Hurry up.

20:16.480 --> 20:17.680
Zhen, let me do it.

20:18.000 --> 20:18.920
Go to work.

20:19.000 --> 20:20.200
Grandpa, let me do it.

20:20.400 --> 20:21.680
Why haven't you left for work yet?

20:21.680 --> 20:23.000
I still have some time.

20:23.200 --> 20:24.070
Go to work.

20:24.180 --> 20:25.020
Got it.

20:25.440 --> 20:27.960
Grandpa, Mother, I'm leaving.

20:28.480 --> 20:29.640
Eat lunch without me.

20:29.640 --> 20:31.350
I have to work at the silk shop
this afternoon.

20:31.350 --> 20:32.610
Be careful on the road.

20:32.640 --> 20:34.170
Say hello to Mr. Shui for me.

20:34.680 --> 20:35.510
Mr. Wu!

20:36.010 --> 20:36.720
Going out, Zhen?

20:36.720 --> 20:37.640
Going to work.

20:41.590 --> 20:42.790
Catch me!

20:42.830 --> 20:43.680
Catch me!

20:43.680 --> 20:44.720
Slow down.

20:45.070 --> 20:45.790
Slow down.

21:09.050 --> 21:10.130
Zhen is here?

21:10.160 --> 21:10.690
Morning!

21:10.720 --> 21:11.250
Morning.

21:14.960 --> 21:15.640
Mr. Shui.

21:16.000 --> 21:16.530
Morning!

21:16.960 --> 21:17.750
Morning.

21:18.310 --> 21:19.070
Zhen.

21:19.820 --> 21:20.240
Morning.

21:20.240 --> 21:20.920
Zhen.

21:21.790 --> 21:23.480
Here, collect the tea leaves.

21:23.550 --> 21:24.160
Okay!

21:29.270 --> 21:30.680
Did you see it today?

21:31.000 --> 21:32.550
The Ten-li Bridal Procession

21:32.550 --> 21:33.550
was spectacular.

21:34.080 --> 21:36.630
I think in Huizhou, it's called...

21:36.690 --> 21:37.710
Full Phoenix Procession.

21:37.710 --> 21:38.620
Is that it?

21:39.000 --> 21:39.800
Yes, exactly.

21:39.830 --> 21:41.200
That's right!

21:41.880 --> 21:42.480
Miss,

21:42.640 --> 21:43.750
what kind of family

21:43.750 --> 21:45.270
can use this Full Phoenix Procession?

21:45.270 --> 21:46.400
Are there any rules?

21:46.590 --> 21:48.400
When a Huizhou woman marries,

21:48.560 --> 21:50.350
they dig a well at the groom's house.

21:50.350 --> 21:52.440
Those with wealth and means

21:52.630 --> 21:55.800
provide a 480-piece
Full Phoenix Procession.

21:55.920 --> 21:57.680
It's to give their daughter support

21:57.680 --> 21:59.350
when living in her husband's home.

21:59.350 --> 22:01.720
It means all her future expenses

22:01.750 --> 22:03.610
are covered by her maiden family,

22:03.820 --> 22:07.100
so she won't have to be subservient

22:07.120 --> 22:08.580
or live at anyone's mercy.

22:08.680 --> 22:10.310
Server, a pot of tea.

22:11.070 --> 22:11.750
Coming!

22:11.920 --> 22:12.680
Mr. Shui,

22:13.010 --> 22:13.660
I'll take care of him.

22:13.660 --> 22:14.350
Okay.

22:16.680 --> 22:18.400
Sir, what would you like to drink?

22:18.400 --> 22:19.660
What do you recommend?

22:20.030 --> 22:20.790
Why don't you try

22:20.790 --> 22:22.400
our new Xianchun tea?

22:22.790 --> 22:24.650
Sure, I'll have a pot of Xianchun.

22:36.000 --> 22:36.750
Sir,

22:36.880 --> 22:38.070
you're from Yangzhou, aren't you?

22:38.070 --> 22:39.440
How did you know I'm from Yangzhou?

22:39.440 --> 22:41.570
Sesame candy is a Yangzhou specialty.

22:42.030 --> 22:43.910
Besides, people from Yangzhou

22:43.940 --> 22:45.270
love having "meat tea",

22:45.310 --> 22:47.310
pairing tea with savory snacks.

22:47.480 --> 22:49.790
I just put two and two together.

22:49.790 --> 22:50.510
Young lady,

22:50.590 --> 22:52.320
you really are knowledgeable.

22:52.590 --> 22:54.050
Here is your Xianchun tea.

22:54.790 --> 22:56.000
Let it steep for a while before drinking.

22:56.000 --> 22:56.590
Okay.

22:57.070 --> 22:58.150
Here, let me help you.

22:58.150 --> 22:58.830
No, no, no need.

22:58.830 --> 22:59.350
I've got it.

22:59.350 --> 23:00.810
Just a quick helping hand.

23:01.030 --> 23:01.960
Thank you.

23:02.350 --> 23:03.110
Sir,

23:03.440 --> 23:05.270
you're in the fur business, aren't you?

23:05.270 --> 23:06.400
Exactly.

23:06.960 --> 23:09.490
These are all goods I imported
from Qingyang.

23:10.170 --> 23:11.850
Speaking of the fur business,

23:11.880 --> 23:14.010
the biggest boss in Huizhou is Jiao Ke.

23:14.110 --> 23:16.000
Have you visited him before?

23:16.030 --> 23:17.310
You mean Boss Jiao?

23:17.310 --> 23:18.160
I know of him,

23:18.480 --> 23:20.110
but he only deals in bulk.

23:20.200 --> 23:21.350
Small merchants like me

23:21.350 --> 23:22.590
are nothing to him.

23:22.590 --> 23:23.550
Even if I went there,

23:23.550 --> 23:25.480
I wouldn't be able to get any goods.

23:26.270 --> 23:28.030
I actually have a way

23:28.030 --> 23:30.030
that might allow you

23:30.030 --> 23:31.590
to get goods from Boss Jiao.

23:31.590 --> 23:32.750
Really?

23:34.510 --> 23:35.960
But some things

23:36.030 --> 23:37.680
are hard to say out loud.

23:39.480 --> 23:40.350
I understand, I understand.

23:40.350 --> 23:41.000
Miss,

23:41.200 --> 23:42.590
give me a pot of your most expensive tea,

23:42.590 --> 23:43.790
the Shexian Lianxin Tea.

23:43.790 --> 23:44.720
Coming right up.

23:44.830 --> 23:45.790
Mr. Shui,

23:46.000 --> 23:47.750
Get a pot of Shexian Lianxin Tea!

23:47.750 --> 23:48.480
Coming.

23:52.720 --> 23:54.270
This Boss Jiao

23:54.400 --> 23:55.720
has a mistress

23:56.070 --> 23:58.070
in the west of the city,

23:58.440 --> 23:59.310
This woman

23:59.350 --> 24:02.110
often brings back some furs to sell.

24:02.200 --> 24:03.200
Why don't you

24:03.350 --> 24:04.610
go check her place out?

24:05.350 --> 24:06.310
Thank you, Miss.

24:06.680 --> 24:07.550
You're welcome.

24:07.550 --> 24:08.350
Wait a moment.

24:08.440 --> 24:09.030
Okay.

24:10.550 --> 24:11.310
Take it.

24:12.680 --> 24:13.510
Mr. Shui,

24:13.790 --> 24:15.270
why are you giving me so much?

24:15.270 --> 24:16.470
If it weren't for you,

24:16.720 --> 24:18.070
my Shexian Lianxin Tea

24:18.070 --> 24:19.870
would mold before it could sell.

24:21.830 --> 24:22.590
Then,

24:22.960 --> 24:24.030
I'll accept it.

24:24.110 --> 24:25.240
Take it, take it.

24:25.550 --> 24:26.310
Child,

24:27.510 --> 24:29.550
let me say a bit more.

24:30.960 --> 24:33.590
You're marrying into
the newly noble Tian family.

24:33.590 --> 24:35.830
Your dowry cannot be shabby.

24:36.480 --> 24:39.480
Has your family prepared
a Full Phoenix Procession for you?

24:39.480 --> 24:40.440
Mr. Shui,

24:40.920 --> 24:42.550
I don't care about those things.

24:42.550 --> 24:43.640
Marriage is about

24:43.640 --> 24:45.370
marrying a person, not things.

24:45.440 --> 24:46.310
Besides,

24:46.350 --> 24:47.510
I have Benchang,

24:47.640 --> 24:49.920
Mom, Grandpa, and my brother.

24:49.960 --> 24:51.440
They are my true backing.

24:51.480 --> 24:52.680
Well said.

24:53.790 --> 24:54.960
Our Zhen

24:54.960 --> 24:56.720
has plenty of confidence.

24:57.000 --> 24:58.790
You're my backing too!

25:07.110 --> 25:07.750
Mother,

25:08.200 --> 25:08.880
here.

25:15.480 --> 25:17.510
Why is there more than usual today?

25:17.760 --> 25:18.760
This morning,

25:18.620 --> 25:21.600
[The eldest son of the Li Family's
Eighth Branch, Li Zhengliang]

25:18.790 --> 25:20.380
the prefect held a birthday banquet

25:20.380 --> 25:21.840
and many guests got drunk.

25:22.060 --> 25:24.480
I made over a dozen trips
with the sedan chair.

25:24.480 --> 25:26.160
I split the earnings with Zhou.

25:26.160 --> 25:28.270
After deducting the sedan rental fee,

25:28.270 --> 25:29.510
this is what is left.

25:29.960 --> 25:31.020
That is wonderful.

25:31.880 --> 25:34.240
The Captain's daughter-in-law
is giving birth soon.

25:34.240 --> 25:35.610
I spoke with the steward.

25:35.610 --> 25:37.350
to help in the kitchen
during the full month banquet.

25:37.350 --> 25:38.810
and earn some extra money.

25:39.400 --> 25:41.000
Even if we cannot afford

25:41.030 --> 25:42.640
half a Phoenix Procession,

25:43.590 --> 25:45.790
it will still help with expenses later.

25:46.030 --> 25:47.550
We will not let Zhen suffer.

25:47.550 --> 25:48.200
Right.

25:48.440 --> 25:49.160
Grandpa.

25:50.000 --> 25:50.680
Father.

25:59.350 --> 26:00.070
Father.

26:00.830 --> 26:02.070
What... what is this?

26:02.640 --> 26:04.240
Zhen is getting married.

26:05.640 --> 26:07.000
I have to support her too.

26:07.000 --> 26:07.750
Grandpa,

26:08.270 --> 26:10.070
where did you get so much money?

26:12.640 --> 26:14.300
Chen San is opening a new shop.

26:14.590 --> 26:17.750
I forced him to only use
my tables and chairs.

26:18.720 --> 26:20.350
He paid me in advance.

26:20.920 --> 26:22.790
I have to rush these next few days

26:22.880 --> 26:24.080
to get it done for him.

26:24.880 --> 26:26.140
Mother, I will go help.

26:28.110 --> 26:29.350
Take care of Grandpa.

26:39.310 --> 26:40.200
Mr. Shui,

26:40.200 --> 26:41.270
is Zhen here?

26:41.920 --> 26:42.510
Yes.

26:49.610 --> 26:51.390
[Daughter of the Tian family,
Tian Ronghua]

26:50.270 --> 26:51.640
Sister-in-law.

26:53.720 --> 26:55.200
Who told you to call me that?

26:55.200 --> 26:56.030
Stop it.

26:56.580 --> 26:57.680
My good sister-in-law,

26:57.680 --> 27:00.080
what magic spell
did you cast on my brother?

27:00.720 --> 27:02.680
After he returned from
delivering bamboo shoots to you that day,

27:02.680 --> 27:04.070
he kept pestering Mother,

27:04.070 --> 27:06.110
telling her
to set the wedding date immediately.

27:06.110 --> 27:07.270
As for him,

27:07.290 --> 27:09.070
he just buried himself
in the ink workshop.

27:09.070 --> 27:10.000
He eats and sleeps there,

27:10.000 --> 27:11.530
not coming out day or night.

27:12.480 --> 27:13.400
So,

27:14.070 --> 27:15.270
you know everything?

27:15.310 --> 27:17.240
I know what I need to know.

27:19.830 --> 27:21.790
The shops don't look busy right now.

27:21.790 --> 27:23.480
Let's go to the jewelry shop

27:23.720 --> 27:25.440
and pick out some headpieces and hairpins

27:25.440 --> 27:27.000
for you to wear at the wedding.

27:27.000 --> 27:28.160
I am not going.

27:28.400 --> 27:29.550
First, over the years,

27:29.550 --> 27:30.720
I have saved up quite a few hairpins.

27:30.720 --> 27:31.650
They are enough.

27:31.680 --> 27:32.640
Second,

27:32.830 --> 27:34.720
I have a lot of expenses right now.

27:34.720 --> 27:36.580
I cannot spend money recklessly.

27:37.550 --> 27:39.410
What do you need so much money for?

27:40.590 --> 27:41.830
Let me list them for you.

27:41.830 --> 27:43.000
Our roof is leaking,

27:43.000 --> 27:44.000
so I have to fix it.

27:44.110 --> 27:46.640
Buying medicine
for Grandpa costs money too.

27:46.790 --> 27:47.680
As for my brother,

27:47.680 --> 27:49.590
it looks like he has found someone.

27:49.590 --> 27:50.960
I have to save some for him too.

27:50.960 --> 27:52.960
We cannot let others
look down on him, right?

27:52.960 --> 27:54.640
And the family needs

27:54.720 --> 27:56.550
money to buy silkworms
and plant mulberry trees

27:56.550 --> 27:58.680
to make good fabric for my mother.

27:58.830 --> 28:00.830
She would never bear to
buy it for herself.

28:00.830 --> 28:01.920
And...

28:02.110 --> 28:03.350
Zhen,

28:03.510 --> 28:04.880
you are amazing.

28:04.960 --> 28:05.960
It's nothing.

28:06.240 --> 28:07.480
You know how hard

28:07.590 --> 28:09.830
it's been for our family these years.

28:10.200 --> 28:11.200
Not just me,

28:11.310 --> 28:13.240
but Grandpa, Mother, and my brother

28:13.240 --> 28:14.240
are all like this.

28:14.240 --> 28:16.640
We plan carefully
and look out for each other.

28:16.640 --> 28:18.400
That's how we get by.

28:18.880 --> 28:21.540
No wonder my brother
is determined to marry you.

28:21.590 --> 28:23.440
A housekeeper wife as capable as you

28:23.440 --> 28:25.700
can't be found anywhere else in Huizhou.

28:27.160 --> 28:27.880
No way.

28:28.070 --> 28:29.990
I have to be on my best behavior too.

28:29.990 --> 28:31.410
Otherwise, after you marry in,

28:31.410 --> 28:33.940
you'll probably
start bossing me around too.

28:34.050 --> 28:35.370
Hua,

28:35.400 --> 28:36.510
you're starting up again, aren't you?

28:36.510 --> 28:37.510
I'm gonna get you!

28:38.590 --> 28:40.070
You run pretty fast.

29:26.750 --> 29:27.720
You greedy girl.

29:27.830 --> 29:29.310
Grandpa and your brother aren't back yet.

29:29.310 --> 29:30.310
Don't steal food.

29:31.440 --> 29:33.030
I only had one piece.

29:38.590 --> 29:39.310
Zhen,

29:40.160 --> 29:41.440
that Benchang

29:41.790 --> 29:43.590
is always bringing things over.

29:44.350 --> 29:45.160
And now,

29:45.400 --> 29:46.670
why are you even letting him

29:46.670 --> 29:47.950
chop the wood?

29:48.590 --> 29:49.960
I didn't force him.

29:50.510 --> 29:51.640
He insisted.

29:51.660 --> 29:53.790
He said my brother is too busy working,

29:53.790 --> 29:55.590
so he insisted on coming with me.

30:10.510 --> 30:11.370
This is for you.

30:21.110 --> 30:21.920
Zhen,

30:21.710 --> 30:23.590
[The eldest son of the Tian Family,
Tian Benchang]

30:22.480 --> 30:23.350
is this...

30:24.960 --> 30:27.020
When children of the Ink Guild marry,

30:27.350 --> 30:30.150
exchanging the birthday inkstick
is seen as a vow.

30:31.270 --> 30:33.070
Since we are engaged,

30:33.720 --> 30:35.240
my birthday inkstick

30:36.510 --> 30:37.970
naturally belongs to you.

30:44.550 --> 30:45.310
Zhen,

30:46.310 --> 30:47.110
from now on,

30:48.310 --> 30:50.040
I will carry it with me every day

30:50.240 --> 30:51.200
and cherish it.

31:01.790 --> 31:03.920
I almost forgot to tell you something.

31:05.310 --> 31:08.160
This is the ink order
I negotiated with Registrar Zhang today.

31:08.160 --> 31:09.640
Once this order is filled,

31:09.750 --> 31:12.080
my family's ink workshop will be on track,

31:12.400 --> 31:14.510
and I can give you a better life.

31:16.440 --> 31:17.790
Such a large order...

31:18.000 --> 31:20.750
Given the current scale of your workshop,

31:22.440 --> 31:23.920
isn't it a bit too rushed?

31:23.960 --> 31:26.560
The new lampblack shed
is already being built.

31:26.830 --> 31:28.090
The schedule is tight,

31:28.830 --> 31:29.640
but for you

31:29.920 --> 31:31.440
and our future,

31:31.830 --> 31:33.230
I have to take the chance.

31:33.400 --> 31:34.350
But don't worry.

31:34.680 --> 31:36.160
It's a bit risky,

31:36.830 --> 31:38.200
but I will make sure this order

31:38.200 --> 31:39.590
is delivered smoothly,

31:40.310 --> 31:42.440
and then I'll give you a grand wedding.

31:44.030 --> 31:44.960
I'll be waiting.

31:50.350 --> 31:51.960
I'm off then.

31:53.500 --> 31:54.700
Take care on the way.

32:11.680 --> 32:12.640
Master Liu,

32:13.160 --> 32:15.550
how is the quality
of this batch of lampblack?

32:14.550 --> 32:20.310
[Lampblack: a charcoal ash used for making ink.
It's from ash collected from burning material.]

32:17.110 --> 32:18.350
Uneven texture,

32:18.640 --> 32:19.960
inconsistent color.

32:21.030 --> 32:21.960
All low grade.

32:22.070 --> 32:23.270
How is that possible?

32:23.510 --> 32:24.640
The lampblack collection process
is simple.

32:24.640 --> 32:26.480
The workers are all experienced masters.

32:26.480 --> 32:28.070
I screened the raw materials myself

32:28.070 --> 32:29.160
and I supervised the work.

32:29.160 --> 32:31.020
There shouldn't be any problems.

32:35.160 --> 32:36.270
In your opinion,

32:36.590 --> 32:38.120
where does the problem lie?

32:42.790 --> 32:44.400
Did you build this new shed

32:44.880 --> 32:47.340
strictly according to the specifications?

32:48.110 --> 32:50.270
It was built to scale
based on the dimensions

32:50.270 --> 32:51.510
of the Luo Ink sheds.

32:52.830 --> 32:54.200
That's strange.

32:54.680 --> 32:57.400
If it's an exact replica
of the Luo family's shed,

32:57.400 --> 32:58.640
the product shouldn't

32:58.640 --> 32:59.920
all be of low grade.

33:01.400 --> 33:02.200
Master Liu,

33:02.310 --> 33:04.710
why don't we produce
another batch and see?

33:05.790 --> 33:08.950
The workshop has an order
waiting to be fulfilled.

33:10.480 --> 33:11.680
What did you agree to?

33:12.070 --> 33:13.110
When is the delivery date

33:13.110 --> 33:14.770
for Registrar Zhang's order?

33:14.920 --> 33:16.050
Five hundred sticks

33:16.550 --> 33:17.830
of medium-quality ink a month later.

33:17.830 --> 33:18.640
A month?

33:21.790 --> 33:22.590
Mr. Tian,

33:23.160 --> 33:24.550
at this rate,

33:25.070 --> 33:26.720
I'm afraid you won't make it.

33:28.160 --> 33:28.960
Let me ask you,

33:29.240 --> 33:30.550
how much is the penalty

33:31.160 --> 33:32.290
for a late delivery?

33:34.750 --> 33:35.750
Ten times.

33:35.880 --> 33:36.790
Ten times?

33:37.270 --> 33:38.640
Even mortgaging our entire ink workshop

33:38.640 --> 33:40.500
wouldn't be enough to cover that.

33:40.550 --> 33:42.960
We only have one option left.

33:43.640 --> 33:46.000
We must beg Young Master Wensong.

33:46.110 --> 33:48.110
We're learning the Luo Ink method,
after all.

33:48.110 --> 33:48.720
Besides,

33:48.880 --> 33:49.720
Master Luo

33:49.790 --> 33:51.400
wrote from the capital recently.

33:51.400 --> 33:54.400
He agreed to
Young Master Luo and Ronghua's marriage.

33:54.400 --> 33:55.830
Ronghua's marriage?

33:56.070 --> 33:57.400
Don't worry about that.

33:57.960 --> 33:59.690
As long as we tell him the truth,

34:00.000 --> 34:01.530
he might be willing to help.

34:13.750 --> 34:15.360
Where did it go wrong?

34:30.050 --> 34:34.460
[Jingxin Hall]

34:45.070 --> 34:47.480
Aunt, Wensong is here to see you.

34:49.880 --> 34:51.000
What do you want?

34:52.280 --> 34:53.000
Aunt,

34:53.550 --> 34:55.800
I'm using the newly acquired
thousand-year pine soot

34:55.800 --> 34:57.280
to develop new tribute ink,

34:57.280 --> 34:58.960
but the mixing keeps failing,

34:59.640 --> 35:01.370
so I came to ask for your advice.

35:02.000 --> 35:03.330
I taught you everything

35:03.630 --> 35:05.480
when you were young.

35:06.440 --> 35:08.040
I have nothing left to teach.

35:08.280 --> 35:10.030
This tribute ink matter

35:10.230 --> 35:12.920
concerns the future of the Luo family.

35:13.000 --> 35:13.280
Could you...

35:13.280 --> 35:13.940
Say no more.

35:14.790 --> 35:17.930
[Luo Hanqiong's sister
Luo Mengzhen]

35:15.670 --> 35:16.880
I can't help you.

35:21.550 --> 35:22.320
Aunt,

35:23.690 --> 35:25.620
I'm in charge of the Luo family now.

35:25.950 --> 35:28.070
If I can't develop the tribute ink,

35:28.400 --> 35:29.960
how will the Luo family stand

35:29.960 --> 35:32.030
in the Huizhou ink industry?

35:32.960 --> 35:34.030
I beg you.

35:34.710 --> 35:35.840
Please help me.

35:37.760 --> 35:40.220
Since the day I was widowed
before marriage,

35:42.030 --> 35:43.590
the Luo family and I

35:46.070 --> 35:48.200
have had nothing to do with each other.

35:50.200 --> 35:51.090
Leave.

35:51.920 --> 35:53.720
I won't get up unless you help me.

35:56.480 --> 35:57.710
If you don't leave,

35:59.030 --> 35:59.920
don't ever

36:00.800 --> 36:02.110
come back again.

36:15.030 --> 36:15.880
Young Master.

36:57.480 --> 36:58.280
Young Master.

36:58.710 --> 37:00.360
The Tians are here again.

37:00.760 --> 37:01.670
What for?

37:02.440 --> 37:06.100
He says there's a problem
with the shed dimensions you taught him.

37:09.030 --> 37:11.920
A problem with what I taught him?

37:12.190 --> 37:13.440
That's what he said.

37:17.030 --> 37:18.440
Useless.

37:18.630 --> 37:19.560
I won't see them.

37:19.670 --> 37:20.230
Okay,

37:20.280 --> 37:21.740
I'll tell them to get lost.

37:24.400 --> 37:25.190
Ping'an!

37:27.190 --> 37:28.480
What is it, Young Master?

37:28.480 --> 37:31.800
Is the marriage between Tian Benchang

37:32.630 --> 37:34.840
and the girl from the Li family's
Eighth Branch settled?

37:34.840 --> 37:35.480
Yes.

37:36.070 --> 37:37.190
Call them in.

37:39.720 --> 37:40.600
Yes, sir.

37:50.590 --> 37:51.550
Young Master,

37:51.800 --> 37:52.900
what is the meaning of this?

37:52.900 --> 37:55.340
You produced such inferior lampblack,

37:55.540 --> 37:57.120
yet you dare claim
it was made according to

37:57.120 --> 37:59.490
the specifications of my Luo Ink sheds?

38:02.150 --> 38:02.710
Young Master,

38:02.710 --> 38:04.030
please don't be angry.

38:04.510 --> 38:05.710
We were just afraid of

38:06.070 --> 38:08.070
tarnishing the Luo Ink's reputation,

38:08.070 --> 38:10.590
so we came to ask for your guidance.

38:11.840 --> 38:13.360
My father values old ties.

38:15.550 --> 38:17.880
He removed
the Tian family's slave status

38:18.800 --> 38:20.550
and let you use
the Luo family's techniques

38:20.550 --> 38:22.010
to do some small business.

38:22.480 --> 38:23.550
But look at you.

38:24.800 --> 38:26.800
Instead of putting any effort

38:26.800 --> 38:29.550
into figuring out how to make good ink,

38:30.110 --> 38:31.550
you cut corners

38:31.550 --> 38:34.590
and use Luo family products
to swindle others.

38:35.000 --> 38:37.230
How dare you ask me for guidance?

38:37.400 --> 38:38.200
Young Master,

38:38.630 --> 38:39.510
look,

38:39.800 --> 38:41.660
we're about to become one family.

38:41.960 --> 38:43.360
How are we family?

38:43.400 --> 38:44.400
Didn't Master Luo

38:44.670 --> 38:46.400
send a letter from the capital?

38:46.590 --> 38:48.920
He tacitly approved
your marriage to Hua.

38:49.030 --> 38:50.070
Hua is indeed

38:50.150 --> 38:52.230
a gentle child.

38:52.360 --> 38:53.230
Rest assured,

38:53.280 --> 38:55.760
she will take good care of you
after the marriage

38:55.760 --> 38:57.920
and share your burdens.

39:01.000 --> 39:03.060
You've really calculated this well.

39:03.150 --> 39:06.510
You send your son to marry
an outcast of the Li family,

39:06.880 --> 39:08.940
and then shove your daughter onto me.

39:09.190 --> 39:11.000
You two

39:11.150 --> 39:13.590
keep talking about
devotion to ink,

39:13.670 --> 39:15.470
but what are you actually doing?

39:16.590 --> 39:19.650
As long as you can protect
the Tian family's interests,

39:19.670 --> 39:21.590
you'll do anything.

39:22.150 --> 39:22.760
Hey—

39:24.070 --> 39:24.710
Father!

39:27.440 --> 39:28.240
Young Master,

39:28.510 --> 39:29.710
don't be angry.

39:29.960 --> 39:31.670
Please show some mercy

39:31.670 --> 39:33.150
and help us.

39:33.840 --> 39:34.630
Fine.

39:35.150 --> 39:36.010
Tian Benchang.

39:37.150 --> 39:39.360
Go to the Li family

39:39.510 --> 39:41.150
and borrow their ink formula

39:41.150 --> 39:42.360
for me to take a look.

39:43.070 --> 39:44.200
That's impossible!

39:44.760 --> 39:46.000
That is the Li family's secret formula.

39:46.000 --> 39:47.840
How could they lend it to outsiders?

39:47.840 --> 39:49.400
Didn't your father just say

39:49.710 --> 39:51.030
that once you marry the Li girl,

39:51.030 --> 39:52.510
you'll be one family?

39:53.000 --> 39:54.530
How are you outsiders then?

39:55.360 --> 39:58.110
I, Luo Wensong, always keep my word,

39:59.030 --> 40:01.670
and I keep kindness and grudges distinct.

40:02.480 --> 40:04.680
As long as you can bring me that formula,

40:05.480 --> 40:07.280
I will not only help you build the shed,

40:07.280 --> 40:10.030
but I will also
take your family's ink making

40:10.030 --> 40:11.280
to the next level.

40:11.510 --> 40:12.670
I'll let you see

40:12.670 --> 40:14.480
what true ink making is.

40:16.510 --> 40:17.970
But if you can't borrow it,

40:18.480 --> 40:19.280
Tian Huai'an,

40:20.590 --> 40:22.650
even if you marry your daughter over,

40:23.360 --> 40:24.760
I can still divorce her.

40:26.070 --> 40:26.960
Luo Wensong,

40:27.230 --> 40:28.630
you've gone too far!

40:29.550 --> 40:30.030
Chang.

40:30.030 --> 40:30.510
You—

40:30.960 --> 40:31.400
Father!

40:31.400 --> 40:31.840
Get out.

40:31.840 --> 40:32.280
It's already—

40:32.280 --> 40:33.400
You... Never mind.

40:36.440 --> 40:37.240
Young Master,

40:38.000 --> 40:39.070
I understand

40:39.550 --> 40:40.920
what you mean.

40:41.400 --> 40:42.400
Leave this matter

40:43.550 --> 40:44.710
to me.

40:52.360 --> 40:53.030
Father,

40:53.320 --> 40:54.760
why did you agree to him?

40:55.030 --> 40:57.430
I can't possibly bring this up
with Li Zhen.

40:59.920 --> 41:01.280
Useless fool.

41:01.630 --> 41:02.960
Can't you tell?

41:03.230 --> 41:06.160
This concerns the very survival
of our ink workshop.

41:06.550 --> 41:07.800
Now, even your sister's marriage

41:07.800 --> 41:08.930
is involved in this.

41:09.030 --> 41:10.920
And you're too embarrassed to speak up?

41:10.920 --> 41:12.590
Do you want to ruin both things?

41:12.590 --> 41:14.880
I never thought
Ronghua's marriage to him was appropriate.

41:14.880 --> 41:16.510
Luo Wensong's two previous wives

41:16.510 --> 41:17.550
both died young.

41:17.670 --> 41:19.510
People say he's cursed to be a widower.

41:19.510 --> 41:21.190
Besides, he has a terrible temper.

41:21.190 --> 41:21.920
If Ronghua marries him,

41:21.920 --> 41:23.760
she will never have a good life.

41:24.440 --> 41:25.480
What do you know?

41:26.480 --> 41:28.590
The Luo family is prestigious and wealthy.

41:28.590 --> 41:29.590
Hua will be

41:29.710 --> 41:30.880
marrying up.

41:31.150 --> 41:33.210
We should be thanking our lucky stars

41:33.360 --> 41:34.960
and you're unhappy about it?

41:35.400 --> 41:37.330
If you continue to be this muddled,

41:37.550 --> 41:39.280
I will go to the Li family right now

41:39.280 --> 41:40.740
and call off your marriage

41:40.960 --> 41:41.880
to Zhen.

41:46.510 --> 41:47.760
Listen to me.

41:48.440 --> 41:49.590
I'll tell you

41:50.150 --> 41:51.070
my plan.

41:52.710 --> 41:53.640
All these years,

41:54.000 --> 41:56.800
I had you get close
to the Li family's Eighth Branch

41:56.840 --> 41:59.370
wasn't just to
offer help in their hour of need

41:59.400 --> 42:01.130
when they were at their lowest.

42:01.190 --> 42:02.390
Since you were young,

42:02.590 --> 42:04.630
I saw that you were kind, righteous,

42:04.960 --> 42:06.440
and capable of achieving great things.

42:06.440 --> 42:09.170
That's why I faciliated
your marriage with Zhen.

42:09.630 --> 42:11.400
I want more than you do,

42:11.710 --> 42:13.640
and I think further ahead than you.

42:15.550 --> 42:18.230
There are so many ink experts in Huizhou,

42:18.920 --> 42:20.480
all with deep pockets

42:20.840 --> 42:22.500
and generations of heritage.

42:22.550 --> 42:23.610
But our Tian family

42:23.760 --> 42:25.760
entered the ink industry empty-handed.

42:25.760 --> 42:26.880
Every step we take

42:27.000 --> 42:28.960
must be carved out for ourselves.

42:29.480 --> 42:30.840
You don't understand

42:31.150 --> 42:32.610
the dangers at every turn,

42:33.030 --> 42:34.070
but I must consider

42:34.070 --> 42:36.000
the future of our family.

42:37.440 --> 42:40.030
That's why I'm having you marry Li Zhen,

42:40.320 --> 42:42.710
and that's why I'm having
Hua marry Master Luo.

42:42.710 --> 42:44.370
It's all part of the same plan.

42:46.840 --> 42:48.300
Think about it carefully.

42:49.280 --> 42:50.590
Don't come back until you figure it out.
